        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/business/20260618-vivatech-2026-from-startup-to-french-unicorn-pigment-harnesses-ai-potential",
        "orario": "19:07",
        "timestamp": 1781802420,
        "contenuto_esteso": "How can Europe better support tech startups? It’s a question being asked at Vivatech, Europe’s biggest event for innovation and technology. Business Editor Kate Moody has been speaking to Eleonore Crespo - co-founder and co-CEO of Pigment, a business planning platform that helps firms make strategic decisions using artificial intelligence. The company was founded as a startup in 2019, and has since become one of just a handful of French tech unicorns, valued at over $1 billion."
